@baseUrl = https://localhost:7179

### 1) List all reservations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations

### 2) Create reservation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": 15,
  "passengerId": 1
}

### 3) Get reservation by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/2

### 4) Cancel reservation
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations/2

### 5) Deney B2: try to set server-side fields from client (DTO should ignore them)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": 1,
  "passengerId": 1,
  "pnrCode": "HACK01",
  "createdAt": "2000-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "id": 999
}

### 6) Deney B3: reservation for a non-existent flight
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "flightId": 9999,
  "passengerId": 1
}
